21
00:01:19.907 --> 00:01:24.047
Quesar is the MLAI website and broader direction.

22
00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:29.187
Quasar is the separately configured local website builder service.

23
00:01:30.798 --> 00:01:32.213
Connect.

24
00:01:32.513 --> 00:01:34.328
Choose an origin.

25
00:01:34.628 --> 00:01:39.443
Settings lets the browser reach a local service and check that it answers.

26
00:01:39.743 --> 00:01:43.058
The deployment may supply a default origin.

27
00:01:44.668 --> 00:01:46.308
A new site.

28
00:01:46.608 --> 00:01:48.398
